OL,3,AHelen Jenner announced by Nigel Farage
OL,4,Aas new leader of Reform in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage has announced Helen Jenner
OL,7,Fas the new leader of Reform in Wales,
OL,8,Fafter Dan Thomas stepped down last week
OL,9,Ffollowing his arrest on suspicion of
OL,10,Fassault and of controlling or coercive
OL,11,Fbehaviour.
OL,13,FSpeaking on the steps of the Senedd in
OL,14,FCardiff on Monday, Farage said: "I've
OL,15,Fknown Helen for many, many years. She
OL,16,Fis a determined campaigner."
OL,18,FFarage said he was sorry for former
OL,19,Fleader Thomas's "personal
OL,20,Fdifficulties", but said it had been
OL,21,Funtenable for him to continue.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
